1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:14,430
If I'm a part of a group and people in the group are speaking for the group, but they're speaking in ways that I don't support, I'm going to make a distinction about me and what their messaging is for the group.

2
00:00:15,110 --> 00:00:18,610
It doesn't mean I don't love the group. It doesn't mean I'm not a part of the group.

3
00:00:18,850 --> 00:00:21,570
It just means I'm not a part of that particular group think.

4
00:00:22,190 --> 00:00:27,430
Like when Bill Cosby's allegations came out, there was black people that were like, as a black person, we have to support Bill Cosby.

5
00:00:27,430 --> 00:00:34,310
No, no, no. This black person does not support Bill Cosby. Doesn't mean I don't support black folks, but it means that I don't support this.

6
00:00:35,290 --> 00:00:47,250
I don't support it. And I think it is my responsibility as an individual to separate myself as an individual from a group that I might be considered a part of for a multiple amount of reasons.

7
00:00:48,350 --> 00:00:53,670
When that group is moving in a direction that I don't support. And I don't think there's anything wrong with that.

8
00:00:53,670 --> 00:00:56,590
And I take pride and honor in my agency to do so.

9
00:00:57,430 --> 00:00:58,430
Thank you.

